#N canvas 652 25 789 788 12;
#X text 8 11 readymade_knob.pd v2 - TWO CUPS \, TWO SLOTS (vanilla Pd \, no externals). Listens to the STANDARD TUIO 2 stream (port 3333 \, on by default). A cup resting LEFT (x < 0.5) is the POSITION pot: its angle MOVES the slider. A cup resting RIGHT is the COLOR pot: its angle PAINTS it. Turn \, release \, the slot commits., f 103;
